# Example crontab entries for the grocery monitor.
# Install with:  crontab -e   (paste a line below, fixing the path)
#
# Fields:  minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week  command
#
# Run every day at 07:00 local time:
0 7 * * *   /path/to/grocery-monitor/scripts/run_monitor.sh >> /path/to/grocery-monitor/logs/cron.log 2>&1
#
# Or run every Monday at 06:30 (weekly):
# 30 6 * * 1 /path/to/grocery-monitor/scripts/run_monitor.sh >> /path/to/grocery-monitor/logs/cron.log 2>&1
